{
 "title": "Ansible 标准操作规范（SOP） | MapleFlow",
 "meta_description": "Ansible 安装、Playbook 规范与日常自动化运维 SOP 速查。",
 "article_html": "<header class=post-header><h1 class=\"post-title entry-hint-parent\">Ansible 标准操作规范（SOP）</h1><div class=post-description>Ansible 安装、Playbook 规范与日常自动化运维 SOP 速查。</div><div class=post-meta><span title='2026-01-28 20:00:00 +0800'>January 28, 2026</span>&nbsp;·&nbsp;<span>9 分钟</span>&nbsp;·&nbsp;<span>3586 字</span>&nbsp;·&nbsp;<span>thomasChen</span></div></header><div class=post-toc><p class=post-toc-title>目录</p><nav id=TableOfContents><ul><li><a href=#1-简介>1. 简介</a></li><li><a href=#2-安装与基本配置>2. 安装与基本配置</a></li><li><a href=#3-常用命令>3. 常用命令</a></li><li><a href=#4-playbook-编写规范>4. Playbook 编写规范</a></li><li><a href=#5-日常操作流程sop>5. 日常操作流程（SOP）</a></li><li><a href=#6-故障排查>6. 故障排查</a></li><li><a href=#7-参考链接>7. 参考链接</a></li></ul></nav></div><div class=post-content><p>Ansible 是一款开源的自动化运维工具，基于 Python，通过 SSH 对目标主机执行任务，无需在受管节点安装 Agent。本文整理安装、常用命令、Playbook 规范与日常 SOP，便于在网页上查阅。</p><hr><h2 id=1-简介>1. 简介<a hidden class=anchor aria-hidden=true href=#1-简介>#</a></h2><ul><li><strong>特点</strong>：无 Agent、幂等性、YAML 剧本、模块丰富。</li><li><strong>典型场景</strong>：配置管理、应用部署、批量命令、持续交付。</li></ul><hr><h2 id=2-安装与基本配置>2. 安装与基本配置<a hidden class=anchor aria-hidden=true href=#2-安装与基本配置>#</a></h2><h3 id=21-控制节点安装linuxmacos>2.1 控制节点安装（Linux/macOS）<a hidden class=anchor aria-hidden=true href=#21-控制节点安装linuxmacos>#</a></h3><div class=highlight><div class=chroma><table class=lntable><tr><td class=lntd><pre tabindex=0 class=chroma><code><span class=lnt> 1\n</span><span class=lnt> 2\n</span><span class=lnt> 3\n</span><span class=lnt> 4\n</span><span class=lnt> 5\n</span><span class=lnt> 6\n</span><span class=lnt> 7\n</span><span class=lnt> 8\n</span><span class=lnt> 9\n</span><span class=lnt>10\n</span><span class=lnt>11\n</span></code></pre></td><td class=lntd><pre tabindex=0 class=chroma><code class=language-bash data-lang=bash><span class=line><span class=cl><span class=c1># Ubuntu/Debian</span>\n</span></span><span class=line><span class=cl>sudo apt update <span class=o>&amp;&amp;</span> sudo apt install -y ansible\n</span></span><span class=line><span class=cl>\n</span></span><span class=line><span class=cl><span class=c1># CentOS/RHEL</span>\n</span></span><span class=line><span class=cl>sudo yum install -y ansible\n</span></span><span class=line><span class=cl>\n</span></span><span class=line><span class=cl><span class=c1># macOS</span>\n</span></span><span class=line><span class=cl>brew install ansible\n</span></span><span class=line><span class=cl>\n</span></span><span class=line><span class=cl><span class=c1># 使用 pip 安装（推荐指定版本）</span>\n</span></span><span class=line><span class=cl>pip install ansible-core\n</span></span></code></pre></td></tr></table></div></div><h3 id=22-查看版本与配置>2.2 查看版本与配置<a hidden class=anchor aria-hidden=true href=#22-查看版本与配置>#</a></h3><div class=highlight><div class=chroma><table class=lntable><tr><td class=lntd><pre tabindex=0 class=chroma><code><span class=lnt>1\n</span><span class=lnt>2\n</span></code></pre></td><td class=lntd><pre tabindex=0 class=chroma><code class=language-bash data-lang=bash><span class=line><span class=cl>ansible --version\n</span></span><span class=line><span class=cl>ansible-config dump --only-changed   <span class=c1># 查看当前生效配置</span>\n</span></span></code></pre></td></tr></table></div></div><h3 id=23-清单文件inventory>2.3 清单文件（Inventory）<a hidden class=anchor aria-hidden=true href=#23-清单文件inventory>#</a></h3><p>默认清单：<code>/etc/ansible/hosts</code> 或项目目录下 <code>inventory</code>、<code>hosts</code>。</p><div class=highlight><div class=chroma><table class=lntable><tr><td class=lntd><pre tabindex=0 class=chroma><code><span class=lnt> 1\n</span><span class=lnt> 2\n</span><span class=lnt> 3\n</span><span class=lnt> 4\n</span><span class=lnt> 5\n</span><span class=lnt> 6\n</span><span class=lnt> 7\n</span><span class=lnt> 8\n</span><span class=lnt> 9\n</span><span class=lnt>10\n</span><span class=lnt>11\n</span></code></pre></td><td class=lntd><pre tabindex=0 class=chroma><code class=language-ini data-lang=ini><span class=line><span class=cl><span class=c1># 简单示例 inventory/hosts</span>\n</span></span><span class=line><span class=cl><span class=k>[web]</span>\n</span></span><span class=line><span class=cl><span class=na>192.168.1.10</span>\n</span></span><span class=line><span class=cl><span class=na>192.168.1.11</span>\n</span></span><span class=line><span class=cl>\n</span></span><span class=line><span class=cl><span class=k>[db]</span>\n</span></span><span class=line><span class=cl><span class=na>192.168.1.20</span>\n</span></span><span class=line><span class=cl>\n</span></span><span class=line><span class=cl><span class=k>[prod:children]</span>\n</span></span><span class=line><span class=cl><span class=na>web</span>\n</span></span><span class=line><span class=cl><span class=na>db</span>\n</span></span></code></pre></td></tr></table></div></div><div class=highlight><div class=chroma><table class=lntable><tr><td class=lntd><pre tabindex=0 class=chroma><code><span class=lnt> 1\n</span><span class=lnt> 2\n</span><span class=lnt> 3\n</span><span class=lnt> 4\n</span><span class=lnt> 5\n</span><span class=lnt> 6\n</span><span class=lnt> 7\n</span><span class=lnt> 8\n</span><span class=lnt> 9\n</span><span class=lnt>10\n</span><span class=lnt>11\n</span><span class=lnt>12\n</span><span class=lnt>13\n</span></code></pre></td><td class=lntd><pre tabindex=0 class=chroma><code class=language-yaml data-lang=yaml><span class=line><span class=cl><span class=c># inventory.yml（YAML 格式）</span><span class=w>\n</span></span></span><span class=line><span class=cl><span class=nt>all</span><span class=p>:</span><span class=w>\n</span></span></span><span class=line><span class=cl><span class=w>  </span><span class=nt>children</span><span class=p>:</span><span class=w>\n</span></span></span><span class=line><span class=cl><span class=w>    </span><span class=nt>web</span><span class=p>:</span><span class=w>\n</span></span></span><span class=line><span class=cl><span class=w>      </span><span class=nt>hosts</span><span class=p>:</span><span class=w>\n</span></span></span><span class=line><span class=cl><span class=w>        </span><span class=nt>web1</span><span class=p>:</span><span class=w>\n</span></span></span><span class=line><span class=cl><span class=w>          </span><span class=nt>ansible_host</span><span class=p>:</span><span class=w> </span><span class=m>192.168.1.10</span><span class=w>\n</span></span></span><span class=line><span class=cl><span class=w>        </span><span class=nt>web2</span><span class=p>:</span><span class=w>\n</span></span></span><span class=line><span class=cl><span class=w>          </span><span class=nt>ansible_host</span><span class=p>:</span><span class=w> </span><span class=m>192.168.1.11</span><span class=w>\n</span></span></span><span class=line><span class=cl><span class=w>    </span><span class=nt>db</span><span class=p>:</span><span class=w>\n</span></span></span><span class=line><span class=cl><span class=w>      </span><span class=nt>hosts</span><span class=p>:</span><span class=w>\n</span></span></span><span class=line><span class=cl><span class=w>        </span><span class=nt>db1</span><span class=p>:</span><span class=w>\n</span></span></span><span class=line><span class=cl><span class=w>          </span><span class=nt>ansible_host</span><span class=p>:</span><span class=w> </span><span class=m>192.168.1.20</span><span class=w>\n</span></span></span></code></pre></td></tr></table></div></div><h3 id=24-ssh-与权限>2.4 SSH 与权限<a hidden class=anchor aria-hidden=true href=#24-ssh-与权限>#</a></h3><div class=highlight><div class=chroma><table class=lntable><tr><td class=lntd><pre tabindex=0 class=chroma><code><span class=lnt>1\n</span><span class=lnt>2\n</span><span class=lnt>3\n</span><span class=lnt>4\n</span><span class=lnt>5\n</span><span class=lnt>6\n</span></code></pre></td><td class=lntd><pre tabindex=0 class=chroma><code class=language-bash data-lang=bash><span class=line><span class=cl><span class=c1># 使用密钥（推荐）</span>\n</span></span><span class=line><span class=cl>ssh-keygen -t ed25519 -N <span class=s2>&#34;&#34;</span> -f ~/.ssh/ansible\n</span></span><span class=line><span class=cl>ssh-copy-id user@target_host\n</span></span><span class=line><span class=cl>\n</span></span><span class=line><span class=cl><span class=c1># 测试连通性</span>\n</span></span><span class=line><span class=cl>ansible all -m ping -i inventory\n</span></span></code></pre></td></tr></table></div></div><hr><h2 id=3-常用命令>3. 常用命令<a hidden class=anchor aria-hidden=true href=#3-常用命令>#</a></h2><h3 id=31-临时命令ad-hoc>3.1 临时命令（Ad-hoc）<a hidden class=anchor aria-hidden=true href=#31-临时命令ad-hoc>#</a></h3><div class=highlight><div class=chroma><table class=lntable><tr><td class=lntd><pre tabindex=0 class=chroma><code><span class=lnt> 1\n</span><span class=lnt> 2\n</span><span class=lnt> 3\n</span><span class=lnt> 4\n</span><span class=lnt> 5\n</span><span class=lnt> 6\n</span><span class=lnt> 7\n</span><span class=lnt> 8\n</span><span class=lnt> 9\n</span><span class=lnt>10\n</span><span class=lnt>11\n</span><span class=lnt>12\n</span><span class=lnt>13\n</span><span class=lnt>14\n</span><span class=lnt>15\n</span><span class=lnt>16\n</span><span class=lnt>17\n</span><span class=lnt>18\n</span><span class=lnt>19\n</span><span class=lnt>20\n</span><span class=lnt>21\n</span><span class=lnt>22\n</span></code></pre></td><td class=lntd><pre tabindex=0 class=chroma><code class=language-bash data-lang=bash><span class=line><span class=cl><span class=c1># 语法：ansible &lt;pattern&gt; -m &lt;module&gt; -a &#34;&lt;args&gt;&#34; [-i inventory]</span>\n</span></span><span class=line><span class=cl>\n</span></span><span class=line><span class=cl><span class=c1># 连通性测试</span>\n</span></span><span class=line><span class=cl>ansible all -m ping\n</span></span><span class=line><span class=cl>\n</span></span><span class=line><span class=cl><span class=c1># 执行 shell 命令</span>\n</span></span><span class=line><span class=cl>ansible web -m shell -a <span class=s2>&#34;uptime&#34;</span>\n</span></span><span class=line><span class=cl>ansible web -m <span class=nb>command</span> -a <span class=s2>&#34;df -h&#34;</span>   <span class=c1># 无 shell 解析，更安全</span>\n</span></span><span class=line><span class=cl>\n</span></span><span class=line><span class=cl><span class=c1># 复制文件</span>\n</span></span><span class=line><span class=cl>ansible web -m copy -a <span class=s2>&#34;src=/local/file dest=/remote/file mode=0644&#34;</span>\n</span></span><span class=line><span class=cl>\n</span></span><span class=line><span class=cl><span class=c1># 安装软件包</span>\n</span></span><span class=line><span class=cl>ansible web -m apt -a <span class=s2>&#34;name=nginx state=present update_cache=yes&#34;</span> --become\n</span></span><span class=line><span class=cl>ansible db -m yum -a <span class=s2>&#34;name=mysql-server state=present&#34;</span> --become\n</span></span><span class=line><span class=cl>\n</span></span><span class=line><span class=cl><span class=c1># 管理服务</span>\n</span></span><span class=line><span class=cl>ansible web -m systemd -a <span class=s2>&#34;name=nginx state=started enabled=yes&#34;</span> --become\n</span></span><span class=line><span class=cl>\n</span></span><span class=line><span class=cl><span class=c1># 收集主机信息（Facts）</span>\n</span></span><span class=line><span class=cl>ansible all -m setup\n</span></span><span class=line><span class=cl>ansible all -m setup -a <span class=s2>&#34;filter=ansible_distribution*&#34;</span>\n</span></span></code></pre></td></tr></table></div></div><h3 id=32-剧本playbook执行>3.2 剧本（Playbook）执行<a hidden class=anchor aria-hidden=true href=#32-剧本playbook执行>#</a></h3><div class=highlight><div class=chroma><table class=lntable><tr><td class=lntd><pre tabindex=0 class=chroma><code><span class=lnt> 1\n</span><span class=lnt> 2\n</span><span class=lnt> 3\n</span><span class=lnt> 4\n</span><span class=lnt> 5\n</span><span class=lnt> 6\n</span><span class=lnt> 7\n</span><span class=lnt> 8\n</span><span class=lnt> 9\n</span><span class=lnt>10\n</span><span class=lnt>11\n</span><span class=lnt>12\n</span><span class=lnt>13\n</span><span class=lnt>14\n</span><span class=lnt>15\n</span></code></pre></td><td class=lntd><pre tabindex=0 class=chroma><code class=language-bash data-lang=bash><span class=line><span class=cl><span class=c1># 执行剧本（干跑不执行）</span>\n</span></span><span class=line><span class=cl>ansible-playbook playbook.yml --check --diff\n</span></span><span class=line><span class=cl>\n</span></span><span class=line><span class=cl><span class=c1># 执行剧本</span>\n</span></span><span class=line><span class=cl>ansible-playbook playbook.yml -i inventory\n</span></span><span class=line><span class=cl>\n</span></span><span class=line><span class=cl><span class=c1># 指定额外变量</span>\n</span></span><span class=line><span class=cl>ansible-playbook playbook.yml -e <span class=s2>&#34;env=prod&#34;</span> -e <span class=s2>&#34;version=1.0&#34;</span>\n</span></span><span class=line><span class=cl>\n</span></span><span class=line><span class=cl><span class=c1># 从指定 task 开始</span>\n</span></span><span class=line><span class=cl>ansible-playbook playbook.yml --start-at-task<span class=o>=</span><span class=s2>&#34;Install nginx&#34;</span>\n</span></span><span class=line><span class=cl>\n</span></span><span class=line><span class=cl><span class=c1># 限制主机</span>\n</span></span><span class=line><span class=cl>ansible-playbook playbook.yml --limit web\n</span></span><span class=line><span class=cl>ansible-playbook playbook.yml --limit <span class=s2>&#34;web1:&amp;prod&#34;</span>\n</span></span></code></pre></td></tr></table></div></div><h3 id=33-常用模块速查>3.3 常用模块速查<a hidden class=anchor aria-hidden=true href=#33-常用模块速查>#</a></h3><table><thead><tr><th>模块</th><th>用途</th><th>示例</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>ping</code></td><td>连通性</td><td><code>-m ping</code></td></tr><tr><td><code>command</code> / <code>shell</code></td><td>执行命令</td><td><code>-a \"ls /tmp\"</code></td></tr><tr><td><code>copy</code></td><td>复制文件</td><td><code>src=... dest=...</code></td></tr><tr><td><code>template</code></td><td>模板渲染</td><td><code>src=... dest=...</code></td></tr><tr><td><code>apt</code> / <code>yum</code></td><td>包管理</td><td><code>name=... state=present</code></td></tr><tr><td><code>systemd</code></td><td>服务管理</td><td><code>name=... state=started</code></td></tr><tr><td><code>user</code></td><td>用户管理</td><td><code>name=... state=present</code></td></tr><tr><td><code>file</code></td><td>文件/目录</td><td><code>path=... state=directory</code></td></tr><tr><td><code>lineinfile</code> / <code>blockinfile</code></td><td>编辑文件</td><td>修改单行/块</td></tr><tr><td><code>git</code></td><td>克隆仓库</td><td><code>repo=... dest=...</code></td></tr></tbody></table><hr><h2 id=4-playbook-编写规范>4. Playbook 编写规范<a hidden class=anchor aria-hidden=true href=#4-playbook-编写规范>#</a></h2><h3 id=41-最小示例>4.1 最小示例<a hidden class=anchor aria-hidden=true href=#41-最小示例>#</a></h3><div class=highlight><div class=chroma><table class=lntable><tr><td class=lntd><pre tabindex=0 class=chroma><code><span class=lnt> 1\n</span><span class=lnt> 2\n</span><span class=lnt> 3\n</span><span class=lnt> 4\n</span><span class=lnt> 5\n</span><span class=lnt> 6\n</span><span class=lnt> 7\n</span><span class=lnt> 8\n</span><span class=lnt> 9\n</span><span class=lnt>10\n</span><span class=lnt>11\n</span><span class=lnt>12\n</span><span class=lnt>13\n</span><span class=lnt>14\n</span><span class=lnt>15\n</span><span class=lnt>16\n</span><span class=lnt>17\n</span></code></pre></td><td class=lntd><pre tabindex=0 class=chroma><code class=language-yaml data-lang=yaml><span class=line><span class=cl><span class=c># playbook.yml</span><span class=w>\n</span></span></span><span class=line><span class=cl><span class=nn>---</span><span class=w>\n</span></span></span><span class=line><span class=cl>- <span class=nt>name</span><span class=p>:</span><span class=w> </span><span class=l>确保 Nginx 安装并运行</span><span class=w>\n</span></span></span><span class=line><span class=cl><span class=w>  </span><span class=nt>hosts</span><span class=p>:</span><span class=w> </span><span class=l>web</span><span class=w>\n</span></span></span><span class=line><span class=cl><span class=w>  </span><span class=nt>become</span><span class=p>:</span><span class=w> </span><span class=kc>yes</span><span class=w>\n</span></span></span><span class=line><span class=cl><span class=w>  </span><span class=nt>tasks</span><span class=p>:</span><span class=w>\n</span></span></span><span class=line><span class=cl><span class=w>    </span>- <span class=nt>name</span><span class=p>:</span><span class=w> </span><span class=l>安装 Nginx</span><span class=w>\n</span></span></span><span class=line><span class=cl><span class=w>      </span><span class=nt>apt</span><span class=p>:</span><span class=w>\n</span></span></span><span class=line><span class=cl><span class=w>        </span><span class=nt>name</span><span class=p>:</span><span class=w> </span><span class=l>nginx</span><span class=w>\n</span></span></span><span class=line><span class=cl><span class=w>        </span><span class=nt>state</span><span class=p>:</span><span class=w> </span><span class=l>present</span><span class=w>\n</span></span></span><span class=line><span class=cl><span class=w>        </span><span class=nt>update_cache</span><span class=p>:</span><span class=w> </span><span class=kc>yes</span><span class=w>\n</span></span></span><span class=line><span class=cl><span class=w>\n</span></span></span><span class=line><span class=cl><span class=w>    </span>- <span class=nt>name</span><span class=p>:</span><span class=w> </span><span class=l>启动并开机自启 Nginx</span><span class=w>\n</span></span></span><span class=line><span class=cl><span class=w>      </span><span class=nt>systemd</span><span class=p>:</span><span class=w>\n</span></span></span><span class=line><span class=cl><span class=w>        </span><span class=nt>name</span><span class=p>:</span><span class=w> </span><span class=l>nginx</span><span class=w>\n</span></span></span><span class=line><span class=cl><span class=w>        </span><span class=nt>state</span><span class=p>:</span><span class=w> </span><span class=l>started</span><span class=w>\n</span></span></span><span class=line><span class=cl><span class=w>        </span><span class=nt>enabled</span><span class=p>:</span><span class=w> </span><span class=kc>yes</span><span class=w>\n</span></span></span></code></pre></td></tr></table></div></div><h3 id=42-使用变量与-handlers>4.2 使用变量与 Handlers<a hidden class=anchor aria-hidden=true href=#42-使用变量与-handlers>#</a></h3><div class=highlight><div class=chroma><table class=lntable><tr><td class=lntd><pre tabindex=0 class=chroma><code><span class=lnt> 1\n</span><span class=lnt> 2\n</span><span class=lnt> 3\n</span><span class=lnt> 4\n</span><span class=lnt> 5\n</span><span class=lnt> 6\n</span><span class=lnt> 7\n</span><span class=lnt> 8\n</span><span class=lnt> 9\n</span><span class=lnt>10\n</span><span class=lnt>11\n</span><span class=lnt>12\n</span><span class=lnt>13\n</span><span class=lnt>14\n</span><span class=lnt>15\n</span><span class=lnt>16\n</span></code></pre></td><td class=lntd><pre tabindex=0 class=chroma><code class=language-yaml data-lang=yaml><span class=line><span class=cl>- <span class=nt>hosts</span><span class=p>:</span><span class=w> </span><span class=l>web</span><span class=w>\n</span></span></span><span class=line><span class=cl><span class=w>  </span><span class=nt>vars</span><span class=p>:</span><span class=w>\n</span></span></span><span class=line><span class=cl><span class=w>    </span><span class=nt>app_port</span><span class=p>:</span><span class=w> </span><span class=m>8080</span><span class=w>\n</span></span></span><span class=line><span class=cl><span class=w>    </span><span class=nt>app_user</span><span class=p>:</span><span class=w> </span><span class=l>www-data</span><span class=w>\n</span></span></span><span class=line><span class=cl><span class=w>  </span><span class=nt>tasks</span><span class=p>:</span><span class=w>\n</span></span></span><span class=line><span class=cl><span class=w>    </span>- <span class=nt>name</span><span class=p>:</span><span class=w> </span><span class=l>部署应用包</span><span class=w>\n</span></span></span><span class=line><span class=cl><span class=w>      </span><span class=nt>copy</span><span class=p>:</span><span class=w>\n</span></span></span><span class=line><span class=cl><span class=w>        </span><span class=nt>src</span><span class=p>:</span><span class=w> </span><span class=s2>&#34;app-{{ version }}.tar.gz&#34;</span><span class=w>\n</span></span></span><span class=line><span class=cl><span class=w>        </span><span class=nt>dest</span><span class=p>:</span><span class=w> </span><span class=l>/opt/app/</span><span class=w>\n</span></span></span><span class=line><span class=cl><span class=w>      </span><span class=nt>notify</span><span class=p>:</span><span class=w> </span><span class=l>重启应用</span><span class=w>\n</span></span></span><span class=line><span class=cl><span class=w>\n</span></span></span><span class=line><span class=cl><span class=w>  </span><span class=nt>handlers</span><span class=p>:</span><span class=w>\n</span></span></span><span class=line><span class=cl><span class=w>    </span>- <span class=nt>name</span><span class=p>:</span><span class=w> </span><span class=l>重启应用</span><span class=w>\n</span></span></span><span class=line><span class=cl><span class=w>      </span><span class=nt>systemd</span><span class=p>:</span><span class=w>\n</span></span></span><span class=line><span class=cl><span class=w>        </span><span class=nt>name</span><span class=p>:</span><span class=w> </span><span class=l>myapp</span><span class=w>\n</span></span></span><span class=line><span class=cl><span class=w>        </span><span class=nt>state</span><span class=p>:</span><span class=w> </span><span class=l>restarted</span><span class=w>\n</span></span></span></code></pre></td></tr></table></div></div><h3 id=43-目录结构建议>4.3 目录结构建议<a hidden class=anchor aria-hidden=true href=#43-目录结构建议>#</a></h3><div class=highlight><div class=chroma><table class=lntable><tr><td class=lntd><pre tabindex=0 class=chroma><code><span class=lnt> 1\n</span><span class=lnt> 2\n</span><span class=lnt> 3\n</span><span class=lnt> 4\n</span><span class=lnt> 5\n</span><span class=lnt> 6\n</span><span class=lnt> 7\n</span><span class=lnt> 8\n</span><span class=lnt> 9\n</span><span class=lnt>10\n</span><span class=lnt>11\n</span><span class=lnt>12\n</span><span class=lnt>13\n</span><span class=lnt>14\n</span></code></pre></td><td class=lntd><pre tabindex=0 class=chroma><code class=language-gdscript3 data-lang=gdscript3><span class=line><span class=cl><span class=n>project</span><span class=o>/</span>\n</span></span><span class=line><span class=cl><span class=err>├──</span> <span class=n>inventory</span><span class=o>/</span>\n</span></span><span class=line><span class=cl><span class=err>│</span>   <span class=err>├──</span> <span class=n>hosts</span>\n</span></span><span class=line><span class=cl><span class=err>│</span>   <span class=err>└──</span> <span class=n>group_vars</span><span class=o>/</span>\n</span></span><span class=line><span class=cl><span class=err>│</span>       <span class=err>├──</span> <span class=n>all</span><span class=o>.</span><span class=n>yml</span>\n</span></span><span class=line><span class=cl><span class=err>│</span>       <span class=err>└──</span> <span class=n>prod</span><span class=o>.</span><span class=n>yml</span>\n</span></span><span class=line><span class=cl><span class=err>├──</span> <span class=n>roles</span><span class=o>/</span>\n</span></span><span class=line><span class=cl><span class=err>│</span>   <span class=err>└──</span> <span class=n>nginx</span><span class=o>/</span>\n</span></span><span class=line><span class=cl><span class=err>│</span>       <span class=err>├──</span> <span class=n>tasks</span><span class=o>/</span>\n</span></span><span class=line><span class=cl><span class=err>│</span>       <span class=err>├──</span> <span class=n>handlers</span><span class=o>/</span>\n</span></span><span class=line><span class=cl><span class=err>│</span>       <span class=err>├──</span> <span class=n>templates</span><span class=o>/</span>\n</span></span><span class=line><span class=cl><span class=err>│</span>       <span class=err>└──</span> <span class=n>defaults</span><span class=o>/</span>\n</span></span><span class=line><span class=cl><span class=err>├──</span> <span class=n>playbook</span><span class=o>.</span><span class=n>yml</span>\n</span></span><span class=line><span class=cl><span class=err>└──</span> <span class=n>ansible</span><span class=o>.</span><span class=n>cfg</span>\n</span></span></code></pre></td></tr></table></div></div><hr><h2 id=5-日常操作流程sop>5. 日常操作流程（SOP）<a hidden class=anchor aria-hidden=true href=#5-日常操作流程sop>#</a></h2><h3 id=51-批量执行前检查>5.1 批量执行前检查<a hidden class=anchor aria-hidden=true href=#51-批量执行前检查>#</a></h3><ol><li>确认清单正确：<code>ansible all -m ping -i inventory</code></li><li>确认权限与 sudo：<code>ansible all -m shell -a \"whoami\" --become</code></li><li>使用 <code>--check --diff</code> 做一次模拟执行</li></ol><h3 id=52-发布应用>5.2 发布应用<a hidden class=anchor aria-hidden=true href=#52-发布应用>#</a></h3><ol><li>备份或打快照（如有需要）。</li><li>执行部署剧本：<code>ansible-playbook deploy.yml -e \"version=x.y.z\" -i inventory</code></li><li>检查服务与日志：通过剧本或 Ad-hoc 执行 <code>systemctl status</code>、<code>tail -f log</code>。</li></ol><h3 id=53-配置变更>5.3 配置变更<a hidden class=anchor aria-hidden=true href=#53-配置变更>#</a></h3><ol><li>修改对应 role 的 task/template 或 group_vars。</li><li><code>ansible-playbook site.yml --check --diff</code></li><li>确认无误后：<code>ansible-playbook site.yml</code></li></ol><hr><h2 id=6-故障排查>6. 故障排查<a hidden class=anchor aria-hidden=true href=#6-故障排查>#</a></h2><table><thead><tr><th>现象</th><th>排查命令/方法</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>SSH 连接失败</td><td><code>ssh -v user@host</code>、检查防火墙与 <code>authorized_keys</code></td></tr><tr><td>权限不足</td><td>使用 <code>--become</code> 或配置 sudo 免密</td></tr><tr><td>模块报错</td><td><code>ansible host -m module -a \"...\" -vvv</code> 看详细输出</td></tr><tr><td>变量未定义</td><td><code>ansible-playbook ... -e \"var=value\"</code> 或检查 <code>group_vars</code></td></tr><tr><td>剧本某步失败</td><td>使用 <code>--start-at-task=\"Task名\"</code> 从该任务重跑</td></tr></tbody></table><h3 id=常用调试>常用调试<a hidden class=anchor aria-hidden=true href=#常用调试>#</a></h3><div class=highlight><div class=chroma><table class=lntable><tr><td class=lntd><pre tabindex=0 class=chroma><code><span class=lnt>1\n</span><span class=lnt>2\n</span><span class=lnt>3\n</span><span class=lnt>4\n</span><span class=lnt>5\n</span></code></pre></td><td class=lntd><pre tabindex=0 class=chroma><code class=language-bash data-lang=bash><span class=line><span class=cl><span class=c1># 单主机、详细输出</span>\n</span></span><span class=line><span class=cl>ansible web1 -m shell -a <span class=s2>&#34;id&#34;</span> -vvv\n</span></span><span class=line><span class=cl>\n</span></span><span class=line><span class=cl><span class=c1># 列出该主机的所有 facts</span>\n</span></span><span class=line><span class=cl>ansible web1 -m setup\n</span></span></code></pre></td></tr></table></div></div><hr><h2 id=7-参考链接>7. 参考链接<a hidden class=anchor aria-hidden=true href=#7-参考链接>#</a></h2><ul><li><a href=https://docs.ansible.com/>Ansible 官方文档</a></li><li><a href=https://docs.ansible.com/ansible/latest/collections/index_module.html>Ansible Module Index</a></li><li><a href=https://docs.ansible.com/ansible/latest/user_guide/playbooks_best_practices.html>Ansible Best Practices</a></li></ul></div><nav class=post-nav aria-label=文章导航><a class=post-nav-prev href=/mapleFlow/posts/aiops-state-and-tools.html rel=prev><span class=post-nav-label>上一篇</span>\n<span class=post-nav-title>AIOps：技术现状与常用工具实践</span>\n</a><a class=post-nav-next href=/mapleFlow/posts/sop-gitlab-cicd-guide.html rel=next><span 